<p>Using your connection to Nature, you can see your surrounding area in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 8, 10, 11, 12.</acronym></p><p>Also, while meditating, you are able to detect the presence of creatures around you in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 5.</acronym></p>